/-!
# GeoSeq stage V10-3: improved and new rows of `prop:primepower` (exact search, insight log V10-3)

Generated by `scripts/gen_v10_3_fields.py`. Improved rows: the same `q` with another irreducible `f` (the
value depends on `f`; the paper fixes the smallest `f`); new rows: dimension 2 for `q = 32, 64, 81, 121, 125,
128`, dimension 3 for `q = 128, 169`, dimension 4 for `q = 49, 121, 125` (not covered in the paper). The
parameters were found by `ppbeta.cpp` (exhaustive over the weights); the kernel checks the certificates.
